* addq/subq of a difference of two vsect labels defined further on, to a register and to memory
* ((An)+, -(An), (An), d(An)), as quick-label-diff; the words of the forms with a known value,
* as the Microware assemblers' listings show them.
* fixed: FIXME
* not r68: its objects have zeros from such an instruction on, where its listing shows the words
* expect text: 5888 5919 5c62 5893 596c0006 5488 4e71
 psect quick_label_diff_fwd,0,0,0,0,0
 addq.l #Fw_b-Fw_a,a0
 subq.b #Fw_b-Fw_a,(a1)+
 addq.w #Fw_c-Fw_a,-(a2)
 addq.l #Fw_b-Fw_a,(a3)
 subq.w #Fw_b-Fw_a,6(a4)
 addq.l #2,a0
 vsect
Fw_a ds.w 2
Fw_b ds.w 1
Fw_c ds.l 1
 ends
 ends
